// Bandit Level 9 → Level 10

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Log in to the Bandit Level 9 server using SSH:

        ssh bandit9@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 8.

Step3: List the files in the current directory:

        ls

Step4: A file named `data.txt` is present.

Step5: We need to find the human-readable string preceded by several `=` characters.

Step6: Use the `strings` command to extract readable strings from the file and search for the `=` characters:

        strings data.txt | grep "==="

Step7: The output contains the password required to log in to the next level, `bandit10`.

Step8: Use the obtained password to connect to the next level:

        ssh bandit10@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step9: The Bandit Level 9 → Level 10 challenge is solved.

Step10: Congratulations!! you have solved this problem!!
